  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swe-S Africa Research Partnership Links 2000-2006 - Travel costs JTC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Swe-S Africa Research Partnership Links 2000-2006</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svensk forsknings program f&#xf6;r samarbete (Links) program b&#xf6;rjade i Sydafrika och har &#xf6;ppnat &#xe4;ven i Mellan &#xf6;sten och Nord Afrika och i Asien. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att underl&#xe4;tta samarbete mellan forskare fr&#xe5;n Sverige och Sydafrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Research Partnership (Links) program started with first with S Africa and has since opened in Middle East-North Africa and in Asia. The aim is to facilitate researchers from Sweden and from S Africa to collaborate on research projects.</narrative>
  </description>
